\item \strong{Negative colorbar} (\code{show_neg}): a gradient from \code{neg_color}
to \code{mid_color}, labeled at \code{neg_legend_breaks}. Used by the
activation and post-hoc heatmaps for negative effects.
\item \strong{Not-tested swatch} (\code{show_not_tested}): a single colored
